['Write F(h)=a₁h+a₂h²+…+a₆h⁶+O(h⁷), with a₁≠0. Define κ_n=F^(n)(0)/F′(0)=n!a_n/a₁.','For a rescaled coordinate h=cδ and normalized germ G(δ)=F(cδ)/(ca₁), one has G′(0)=1 and G^(n)(0)=c^(n−1)κ_n.'],
