['Let a₁,…,a₆ be the displayed coefficients. Consider a_n=c₁a_(n−1)+c₂a_(n−2) for every n≥3, with constants c₁,c₂.','Fit c₁,c₂ from the n=3 and n=4 equations only. The coefficient matrix is [[a₂,a₁],[a₃,a₂]], whose determinant is a₂²−a₁a₃.'],
