['For R:D⊂R^n→R^m define I(z)=||R(z)||²/2. Assume D is convex and R is twice differentiable.','The exact Hessian is ∇²I=DRᵀDR+Σ_iR_i∇²R_i. The second term may have either sign away from R=0.'],
