['For paired observations a_i,E_i≥0 choose ε>0, set x_i=log(a_i+ε), y_i=log(E_i+ε), and fit y=b+sx by unweighted least squares.','Let Sxx=Σ(x_i−x̄)² and Sxy=Σ(x_i−x̄)(y_i−ȳ). The fit requires at least one nonconstant x value, so Sxx>0.'],
