['Let f(x)=xᵀHx/2 with H symmetric positive definite and eigenvalues 0<λ_min≤λ_i≤λ_max. Gradient descent is x_(n+1)=(I−ηH)x_n with η>0.','Define q=max_i|1−ηλ_i| and reserve ρ=1−q. This worst-mode reserve differs from monitoring a single observed multiplier.'],
